        { "id": "s10", "text": "Bake 12 to 15 minutes. The cookies spread a lot and look slightly underbaked in the centre. While still warm, tap the tray on the counter and use an upturned bowl to swirl the edges into circles.", "uses": [], "timerMinutes": 12 },
